sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant Root as Checkbox.Root
  participant Ctx as CheckboxRootContext
  participant Ind as Checkbox.Indicator

  Root->>Ctx: provide { checked, disabled }
  Ctx->>Ind: read state
  Note over Root,Ind: checked is true, false or indeterminate —<br/>one of three data-* attributes, never two

  User->>Root: click
  Root->>Root: commitChecked(next)
  Root-->>User: onCheckedChange(next)
  Root->>Ctx: new state
  Ctx->>Ind: re-render, data-indeterminate gives way to data-checked
